n16 drop15 add16       15                 9,10,11,12,13,14,16
n16 best 8-ladder      -                  7,9,11,13,14,15

========================================================================================
EXACT LRC AUDITS OF THE SAME COLUMNS
========================================================================================
These are full interval-union endpoint audits, not just the IP relaxation.  The key pattern is that sieve repairs produce gap or endpoint debt, not open covers.
